    {
     "section": "DecUnderArticle",
     "section_title": "Declarations made under articles 10 and",
     "notes": [],
     "label": null,
     "kind": "competence_declaration",
     "text": "The Kingdom of Belgium recognizes the competence of the Committee on Economic, Social and Cultural Rights\n- to receive, in accordance with article 10 of the Optional Protocol, notifications from a State Party that another State Party is not fulfilling its obligations, or\n- to conduct, in accordance with articles 11 and 12 of the Optional Protocol, an inquiry regarding serious and systematic violations by another State Party of one of the Economic, Social and Cultural Rights described in the Covenant."
    }
   ],
